Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.43,0:00:06.53,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.47,0:00:17.47,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.51,0:00:22.31,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.19,0:00:26.05,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:33.56,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.26,0:00:40.22,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.57,0:00:48.34,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:54.35,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:58.18,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.19,0:01:02.85,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:09.36,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.30,0:01:20.26,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:36.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙是为了抑制
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.75,0:01:39.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的妖怪之血的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:41.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果无法自在的挥动铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.42,0:01:44.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉会再度妖化成妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.15,0:01:47.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法再忍耐下去的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:49.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从刀刀斋爷爷得知
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.06,0:01:52.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让铁碎牙变轻的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.93,0:01:57.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是打倒曾经被 犬夜叉的父亲所封印
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.47,0:02:00.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫做龙骨精的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:10.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想打倒苏醒的龙骨精
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.41,0:02:12.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,方法只有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.91,0:02:14.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了爆流破别无它法
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:16.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆流破？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.62,0:02:19.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是铁碎牙的奥义
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.52,0:02:20.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.99,0:02:22.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉别说是风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.13,0:02:24.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连挥动铁碎牙都很吃力了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:27.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更何况是奥义
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.06,0:02:32.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第54话 铁碎牙的奥义 爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.83,0:02:50.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的臭小子 马上让你解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:09.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉没有拿着铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:12.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点醒醒 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.99,0:03:15.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.03,0:03:21.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:27.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这妖气是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:30.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟刚才完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.98,0:03:42.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙的血觉醒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:46.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也好 这样比较有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:51.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好 犬夜叉妖化了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:52.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:00.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:01.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点解除妖化
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:06.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.37,0:04:07.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样妖化
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:09.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用爪子与龙骨精战斗的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.11,0:04:12.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许能救你的命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:14.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 铁碎牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:21.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙就无法变轻了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:27.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼 少得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.85,0:04:49.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.05,0:04:52.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然能将龙骨精的庞大身躯…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:55.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉打败他了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.66,0:04:57.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快撤退吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.43,0:04:59.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:00.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一看就明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.66,0:05:02.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉那小子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:05.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用妖怪的姿态战斗着
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.17,0:05:08.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以要丢下他吗 怎么这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.74,0:05:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再待在这里的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:12.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在龙骨精之后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.74,0:05:15.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许就会攻击我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.24,0:05:17.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.45,0:05:19.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷反覆的妖化
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:21.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会无法分辨敌我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:24.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 连你也不例外
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:28.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:31.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷 你快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:34.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我下去 刀刀斋爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:36.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要留在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.90,0:05:38.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这道理我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:42.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.34,0:05:45.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.91,0:05:49.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我丢下战斗中的犬夜叉逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:50.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我实在做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:56.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你 刀刀斋爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.85,0:05:57.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:06:00.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我我我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:03.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 拿你没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.63,0:06:04.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:05.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的样子…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:29.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.82,0:06:31.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.52,0:06:33.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明已经妖化了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:35.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他还是想用铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:40.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道这小子和戈薇说的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.27,0:06:49.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实犬夜叉现在正在战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.27,0:06:52.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己的心与 体内流动的妖怪之血
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.97,0:06:55.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子正在拼命的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:58.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:07.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…臭小子竟然得意忘形
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.79,0:07:12.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏到此结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.43,0:07:16.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:25.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:40.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙的刀鞘？怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.59,0:07:41.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:44.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘的结界吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.16,0:07:45.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.39,0:07:48.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前和雷兽兄弟战斗时也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:07:59.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错！铁碎牙的刀鞘
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.04,0:08:02.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾经将雷兽兄弟的雷击弹开
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:03.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:06.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙的刀鞘保护了犬夜叉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:09.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 不过没有第二次了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:11.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘已经撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:15.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为那种东西有用吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.09,0:08:16.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.93,0:08:18.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:22.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.10,0:08:27.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:29.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好惊人的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.19,0:08:45.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉开了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:46.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才真的好险
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.36,0:08:50.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.83,0:08:52.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是稍微改变那妖气的轨道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.59,0:08:54.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就必须耗费这么多的体力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:56.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对这么强的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:58.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉却只能独自一人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:18.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼的妖气正在消失
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:31.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然用那么庞大的身躯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.60,0:09:33.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,压在别人的刀上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:38.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙骨精
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.01,0:09:41.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要用这把铁碎牙打倒你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.12,0:09:51.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭你那孱弱的模样 与那把钝刀吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:52.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笑死人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:54.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:55.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是不用这把铁碎牙战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.92,0:09:57.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就毫无意义了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:09:58.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:00.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再手下留情了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:16.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是我的错觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:20.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙…正在变轻
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.19,0:10:35.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快看！犬夜叉将铁碎牙…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.66,0:10:36.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:41.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在贯穿龙骨精的心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:49.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:09.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命中了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.56,0:11:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贯穿了龙骨精的心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.60,0:11:14.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.88,0:11:25.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好轻！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.61,0:11:28.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来沉重的铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:30.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像紧紧吸在手上一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:34.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然用刀刃将我…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.02,0:11:39.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼 我要宰了你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:48.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没死啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:55.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可怕的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.64,0:11:57.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心脏被贯穿了还没事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:02.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙骨精是连犬夜叉的父亲 都感到棘手的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:05.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非粉身碎骨那家伙才会死
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:07.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换我了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.68,0:12:31.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:34.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 身体竟然这么硬
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.32,0:12:39.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早说过那把钝刀没有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.09,0:12:44.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个气息…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.59,0:12:46.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是风之伤的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:54.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤围绕着铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.21,0:13:00.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼 到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:03.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙骨精 我要让你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.18,0:13:06.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的我哪里不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:12.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.10,0:13:24.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.23,0:13:25.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.23,0:13:26.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.47,0:13:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打倒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:44.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙不是只有变轻而已
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.65,0:13:48.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还可以随时施展风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.89,0:13:52.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见没 刀刀斋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.53,0:13:54.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我办到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.50,0:13:57.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止还值得称赞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:13:59.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是要安心还太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:02.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.19,0:14:21.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吗 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:25.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太让我失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.53,0:14:30.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点程度就想打倒我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.80,0:14:31.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挨了风之伤依然好端端的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.94,0:14:38.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就说了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.31,0:14:39.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.31,0:14:43.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的身体比钢铁更坚硬
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.18,0:14:46.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 现在换我了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:48.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.95,0:14:50.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先逃离这里再说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.45,0:14:51.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙要来真的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.19,0:14:53.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.09,0:15:01.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙…好惊人的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:04.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是惊叹的时候 快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.93,0:15:05.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:08.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙骨精可是干劲十足
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.84,0:15:11.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之你已经能使用铁碎牙了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:13.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.57,0:15:14.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.11,0:15:16.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少说这么悠哉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:19.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在等待这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.23,0:15:32.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.59,0:15:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是不解决掉这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.76,0:15:36.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要如何超越老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.73,0:15:40.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.97,0:15:42.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你父亲一同踏上黄泉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.14,0:15:43.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好大！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.34,0:15:45.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也会被卷进去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.01,0:15:47.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 快离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.35,0:16:01.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才的妖气块与这相比
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.66,0:16:03.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直小的可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:04.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.76,0:16:06.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.90,0:16:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要粉碎龙骨精强韧的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:14.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然还是得使出爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:16.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在的犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.31,0:16:18.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躲不掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.61,0:16:22.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经无处可躲了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:26.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么只有砍过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:44.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才的妖气块与这相比简直小得可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:49.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经无处可躲了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.61,0:16:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么只有砍过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.39,0:17:04.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.03,0:17:07.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.60,0:17:11.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子使出了爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.37,0:17:15.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那股气流
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.90,0:17:16.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要用风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:18.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扫过那股焦臭味的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:23.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.72,0:17:31.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.89,0:17:33.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小鬼的刀气
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:36.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然将我的妖气卷进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.17,0:17:51.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么有这种傻事…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.45,0:18:03.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙气流的漩涡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.39,0:18:06.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将龙骨精妖气压回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.26,0:18:18.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能会有这种事的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.77,0:18:25.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的身体…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.71,0:18:28.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我钢铁般的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.23,0:18:51.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.47,0:18:54.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和以前的风之伤完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.21,0:18:58.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.98,0:18:59.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.64,0:19:01.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.48,0:19:03.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你成功了 好了不起喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:06.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,龙骨精完全灰飞烟灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.49,0:19:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.22,0:19:10.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么办到的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:13.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.69,0:19:17.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不愧是犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.13,0:19:20.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我一直相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.97,0:19:24.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷一直撒手不管吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:28.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 刀刀斋你…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.71,0:19:33.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候你还满灵光的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.81,0:19:36.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在铁碎牙里加了什么机关吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.25,0:19:38.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比之前强太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.52,0:19:43.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还搞不清楚状况吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.32,0:19:48.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那就是铁碎牙的奥义
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.23,0:19:50.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.43,0:19:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆流…破？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.77,0:19:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才的就是爆流破吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.43,0:19:59.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 所谓的爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.44,0:20:03.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是将对方的妖气卷入风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:05.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再让妖气逆流的必杀剑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:09.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卷入风之伤 使妖气逆流？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.28,0:20:11.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卷在一起的风之伤与妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.78,0:20:13.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会变成漩涡然后压回来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:17.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人会完全承受
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.35,0:20:20.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己的妖气与铁碎牙的威力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.09,0:20:24.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正就是这种道理
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.46,0:20:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管如此
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.73,0:20:30.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了找出斩断妖气的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:32.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更重要的 若不能发出
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.57,0:20:35.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,足以压倒敌人妖气 的强气的话就不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.37,0:20:37.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很厉害嘛 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.58,0:20:42.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是试着朝 焦臭味的方向砍过去而已
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:46.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然超越了理论
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:49.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子也许是 超乎我想象的大人物
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:51.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 总之这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.82,0:20:54.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就能自在的操控铁碎牙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:56.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不只是这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.26,0:20:58.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看了别吓一跳喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:11.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.84,0:21:12.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:14.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时都能施展风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:22.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如何 轻而易举
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:28.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 别这样 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.39,0:21:30.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么危险的刀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.03,0:21:32.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可以随便乱挥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.13,0:21:37.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也没有人能赢我了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:39.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不甘心的话来阻止我呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.37,0:21:40.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.57,0:21:43.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.78,0:21:45.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 像你这种人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.14,0:21:48.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一下子就得意忘形
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:50.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.38,0:21:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不振作一点的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.32,0:21:55.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…被戈薇讨厌了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:01.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然 还不成气候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:04.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.70,0:22:29.17,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.74,0:22:41.25,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.96,0:22:48.66,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.26,0:22:51.96,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.23,0:22:56.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.74,0:23:03.47,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.48,0:23:11.41,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.32,0:23:18.95,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.43,0:23:26.23,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.80,0:23:34.54,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.76,0:23:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小女孩独自等待着 去打仗后就没有回来的哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.06,0:23:54.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五月拥有能够 实现梦想的宝贝 四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.67,0:23:57.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是真的话 不拿走不行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.07,0:23:59.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苦恼的七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.47,0:24:02.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道他喜欢五月吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.04,0:24:03.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.01,0:24:05.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以四魂碎片为目标的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.74,0:24:07.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又设下卑鄙的陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.85,0:24:10.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.28,0:24:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石之花与七宝的初恋
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.45,0:24:14.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
